# On Linux the address sanitizer also runs LeakSanitizer. The XCTest runner of the toolchain
# allocates its suite and test lists once and never frees them, and it does so even when a
# package has no XCTest tests. Every stack with a frame in libXCTest is that runner's.
leak:libXCTest.so
